// FIRSTWARD_FUNERAL_ORATION_TEXT :
"P4270861477" "It is indeed a sad day in First Ward.  We lay another brother to rest."
// FIRSTWARD_FUNERAL_ORATION_TEXT :
"P4244633586" "In his youth, he was a spitfire.  His passion for life was beyond limits.  We mourn this day..."
// FIRSTWARD_FUNERAL_ORATION_TEXT :
"P2415691097" "Today we lay to rest our good friend and brother.  Join me in remembering our dear friend."
// FIRSTWARD_FUNERAL_ORATION_TEXT :
"P461794275" "This is a sad day, brothers and sisters."
// FIRSTWARD_FUNERAL_ORATION_TEXT :
"P3959457616" "On this day, we say goodbye to our brother.  Join me in remembrance."

// FIRSTWARD_PASTOR_FLEEING_TEXT :
"P3705632327" "What are you doing?!"
// FIRSTWARD_PASTOR_FLEEING_TEXT :
"P2966808439" "Everyone, run for your lives!"
// FIRSTWARD_PASTOR_FLEEING_TEXT :
"P1076491693" "How can you possibly live with yourself?"
// FIRSTWARD_PASTOR_FLEEING_TEXT :
"P3517856215" "I forgive you!"
// FIRSTWARD_PASTOR_FLEEING_TEXT :
