// FIRSTWARD_PASTOR_FLEEING_TEXT :
"P1865803235" "But..but...this is a memorial service?  How could you??"
// FIRSTWARD_PASTOR_FLEEING_TEXT :
"P2199370680" "You are not a nice person!"

// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_HAWKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3574594043" "Are you enlightened enough?  Do you want to be?  Step inside the CDEC!"
// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_HAWKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2540158762" "The Cultural Direction and Education Center will change the way you think!  Check it out!"
// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_HAWKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P970180578" "You never know how much you don't know until someone tells you what you need to know!  So...get in the know!"
// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_HAWKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P424462511" "Learn more about the Cultural Direction and Education Center.  See a consultant!"
// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_HAWKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3264499623" "The Cultural Direction and Education Center is open 24 hours a day to teach YOU!  Check it out!"
// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_HAWKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3378310552" "You have a lot to learn!  The Cultural Direction and Education Center will teach you!  Check it out!"
// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_HAWKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P487419042" "Rest assured, the Cultural Direction and Education Center is 100% approved by Emperor Cole!"
// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_HAWKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P723787406" "Want to learn how to use Inventions?  Visit a consultant in the Cultural Direction and Education Center today!"
// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_HAWKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P67833807" "Get in the know, my friend!  Visit the Cultural Direction and Education Center."

// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_HAWKER_ATTACKEDFLEE_TEXT :
"P664850861" "Hey, take a pamphlet!"
// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_HAWKER_ATTACKEDFLEE_TEXT :
"P3915049633" "Don't think I didn't see you ignore me.  That's not very enlightened of you."
// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_HAWKER_ATTACKEDFLEE_TEXT :
"P3241138275" "The old 'didn't see you' trick.  I get it.  Your loss.<em>Step right up!  Take a pamphlet!"
// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_HAWKER_ATTACKEDFLEE_TEXT :
"P914765615" "Knowledge is power, friend."
// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_HAWKER_ATTACKEDFLEE_TEXT :
"P2390362291" "An enlightened one would not act as you do!"

// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_QUESTIONER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1675541810" "I'm really not sure about this thing on page 3..."
// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_QUESTIONER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P865272889" "Right, but how do I know that MY enlightenment is the same as YOUR enlightenment?"
// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_QUESTIONER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1558128083" "Can you really DEFINE enlightenment?"
// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_QUESTIONER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4013287377" "Really...what IS enlightenment anyway?  Is it, like, a mental light bulb maybe?"
// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_QUESTIONER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2979604694" "Nah, I'm still feeling kind of unenlightened and I'm just not getting how this all works."
// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_QUESTIONER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P232030072" "Could you explain that one more time?"
// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_QUESTIONER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1137592524" "I don't get it..."
// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_QUESTIONER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3181248506" "Wow.  That is really deep.  I mean DEEP."
// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_QUESTIONER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1116798691" "Fascinating.  Simply fascinating."
// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_QUESTIONER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P648218548" "Well, I did not know that.  Thank you so much for enlightening me!"

// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_QUESTIONER_ATTACKEDFIGHT_TEXT :
