// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_QUESTIONER_ATTACKEDFIGHT_TEXT :
"P3865824471" "You go ahead.  I don't mind waiting."
// IMPERIAL_CDECPAMPHLET_QUESTIONER_ATTACKEDFIGHT_TEXT :
"P319687631" "Hmmm..."

// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_TALKING_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3885497509" "You know, I can't imagine living in any other city than Imperial City.  It is simply the most beautiful place there is."
// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_TALKING_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P222186125" "Every day I am awestruck by how well Emperor Cole keeps us safe.  Aren't you?"
// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_TALKING_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1658862563" "Were it not for Emperor Cole, we would all be doomed, don't you think?"
// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_TALKING_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P100097578" "Did you know that we named our daughter Cola?  It's like a little cute spin on Cole.  Quite an homage wouldn't you say?"
// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_TALKING_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1041226021" "My sister has been working at Athena Labs for years.  She loves it."
// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_TALKING_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1726687660" "My brother works at Crown Distribution.  Oh, he's doing some technical computer security thingy.  I don't know much about it."
// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_TALKING_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3973731598" "We work hard to afford our place in Aureas, but it's reasonable for the amenities."

// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_TALKING_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4215075729" "I agree wholeheartedly!"
// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_TALKING_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3743801283" "You speak the truth."
// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_TALKING_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2409108463" "That is SO true."
// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_TALKING_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3344650875" "Really."
// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_TALKING_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2917888649" "Really?"
// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_TALKING_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2370641231" "Hm."
// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_TALKING_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2879275415" "I see."
// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_TALKING_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1794994242" "I'll have to think about that."
// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_TALKING_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3393544219" "Is that true?"
// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_TALKING_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3823584633" "Well that's something."
// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_TALKING_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3553745229" "No kidding."
// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_TALKING_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P560978387" "You can say that again."

// IMPERIAL_NEWSIE_HAWKING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1227640762" "Latest news in Imperial City, right here!  Come and get it!"
// IMPERIAL_NEWSIE_HAWKING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P334859745" "From the Total Praetoria Network to you, find out what's going on in Imperial City!"
// IMPERIAL_NEWSIE_HAWKING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1704720520" "All's well and that's from the horse's mouth!"
// IMPERIAL_NEWSIE_HAWKING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3329885586" "Resistance Activity SQUASHED by Emperor Cole's dedicated and loyal police force!"
// IMPERIAL_NEWSIE_HAWKING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3904680645" "Looks like another sunny day in Praetoria!  For all your weather and news information, pick up a paper or watch the network!"
// IMPERIAL_NEWSIE_HAWKING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P633106300" "All this brought to you by TPN!  Total Praetoria Network!  All the news all the time!"
// IMPERIAL_NEWSIE_HAWKING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P699894978" "TPN, the Total Praetoria Network! Truth Provided Nightly!"
// IMPERIAL_NEWSIE_HAWKING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2685558759" "TPN, the Total Praetoria Network! Terrifically Poignant News!"
// IMPERIAL_NEWSIE_HAWKING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P36672046" "The Destroyers: Mentally Ill or Tools of the Hamidon? Find out now from TPN!"

// IMPERIAL_NEWSIE_HAWKING_ALERTED_NOATTACK_TEXT :
