// IMPERIAL_NEWSIE_HAWKING_ALERTED_NOATTACK_TEXT :
"P3079061372" "Beautiful day isn't it?  Want to buy a paper?"

// IMPERIALCITY_READPOSTER_WRITEINFO_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3236514034" "That is SO true.  I have to get this down."
// IMPERIALCITY_READPOSTER_WRITEINFO_INACTIVE_TEXT :
