// IMPERIALCITY_WAITTRAIN_CHATTYWAITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1647523768" "Lovely day, isn't it?"
// IMPERIALCITY_WAITTRAIN_CHATTYWAITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2704992318" "The sun always shines in Praetoria, don't you think?"
// IMPERIALCITY_WAITTRAIN_CHATTYWAITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2943524399" "How are you doing on this fine day?"
// IMPERIALCITY_WAITTRAIN_CHATTYWAITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1588333269" "I think it'll be quite a day today.  Sunny, I bet.  Perfect for a picnic in the People's Park."
// IMPERIALCITY_WAITTRAIN_CHATTYWAITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P198657423" "You waiting on a train, too?"
// IMPERIALCITY_WAITTRAIN_CHATTYWAITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P22252112" "You know, public transit is just so much more ecologically friendly.  Wouldn't you agree?"
// IMPERIALCITY_WAITTRAIN_CHATTYWAITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3932094931" "I love this train.  I can get to my destination in a flash."
// IMPERIALCITY_WAITTRAIN_CHATTYWAITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1917702623" "Another glorious day, isn't it?"
// IMPERIALCITY_WAITTRAIN_CHATTYWAITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P94086282" "Some days, I wake up and I'm just glad to be a Praetorian.  I bet you think that, too."
// IMPERIALCITY_WAITTRAIN_CHATTYWAITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1449506277" "Bet that train is running on time.  It always does."
// IMPERIALCITY_WAITTRAIN_CHATTYWAITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4183101804" "Two things you can count on in Praetoria: beautiful weather and a train on time.  Mark my words!"
// IMPERIALCITY_WAITTRAIN_CHATTYWAITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4176173408" "I'm not sure I've seen you on this route.  You from around here?"
// IMPERIALCITY_WAITTRAIN_CHATTYWAITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2605865027" "Don't worry about rumors about the tunnels, they seal off any restricted areas from the transit system."

// IMPERIALCITY_WAITTRAIN_CHATTYWAITER_ATTACKEDFLEE_TEXT :
"P2213044217" "Ow!  What was that for?  I'm calling security!"
// IMPERIALCITY_WAITTRAIN_CHATTYWAITER_ATTACKEDFLEE_TEXT :
