// IMPERIALCITY_WAITTRAIN_CHATTYWAITER_ATTACKEDFLEE_TEXT :
"P334726653" "Well I never!"

// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_COLESTRUCK_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2883733205" "Emperor Cole is so amazing.  Whatever would we do without him?"
// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_COLESTRUCK_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4211756449" "Emperor Cole is a fine, fine man.  We are so lucky to have him for a leader."
// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_COLESTRUCK_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1812421367" "Every day I am so grateful that Emperor Cole is here to protect us."
// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_COLESTRUCK_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1418450171" "Emperor Cole just has everything in our best interest.  It's perfect."
// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_COLESTRUCK_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1048214495" "Have you tried the Cole-approved Enriche bottled water yet?  It's simply divine!"
// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_COLESTRUCK_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4287723911" "I feel so secure in Praetoria.  I give Emperor Cole all the credit."
// IMPERIAL_CONVERSATION_COLESTRUCK_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1807888289" "I love living here.  Everything is so beautiful.  Emperor Cole takes such great care of us!"

