// NOVA_MAGISTERIUM_NPC_SKETCH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P422299008" "What a joy to sketch a city as beautiful as this."
// NOVA_MAGISTERIUM_NPC_SKETCH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
