// NOVA_MAGISTERIUM_NPC_BENCHCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3496858519" "I love working at the Ministry of Technology.  It's just a few blocks from my home and such a rewarding job."
// NOVA_MAGISTERIUM_NPC_BENCHCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3632990361" "I do feel like there will always be people who are simply not satisfied.  It's the way of the world.  They simply do not appreciate what they have."
// NOVA_MAGISTERIUM_NPC_BENCHCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1286090415" "Hm.  It's getting late.  I should probably get back soon.  I have some reports to complete."
// NOVA_MAGISTERIUM_NPC_BENCHCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2065776323" "I'll be heading over to Tiberian Bluff this evening for some star-watching with friends.  Did you want to join us?"
// NOVA_MAGISTERIUM_NPC_BENCHCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4153580747" "I may spend some time in Architect Entertainment, but truly, why would I want to hide away in some simulated life when I live this wonderful perfect one out here?"

