"P400152617" "Pizza?  Sounds good.  My half?  Pepperoni, mushroom, and black olive."

// IMPERIAL_NPC_COFFEECHAT_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2811180461" "There's always one in every crowd.  Let the Clockwork take care of them.  They always do."
// IMPERIAL_NPC_COFFEECHAT_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2317746212" "I heard he was recently hired on at TPN Today.  How great a job is that?"
// IMPERIAL_NPC_COFFEECHAT_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2071490809" "When did she start working at Kantir Corporation?  Oh how fabulous!"
// IMPERIAL_NPC_COFFEECHAT_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3605226716" "No, Novahold Storage.  It's the best.  I've used them for years."

// IMPERIAL_NPC_COFFEECHAT_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P804345185" "I like the way you think.  It is exactly how I think."
// IMPERIAL_NPC_COFFEECHAT_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2790589462" "I didn't know that."
// IMPERIAL_NPC_COFFEECHAT_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1231526072" "You're so smart."

// IMPERIAL_NPC_DOCTORCONSULT_TALKER_TEXT :
"P2489580280" "Sounds like we may have to send them over to the Psych Hospital for a consult."
// IMPERIAL_NPC_DOCTORCONSULT_TALKER_TEXT :
"P591980644" "Looks like I'll be working late tonight."
// IMPERIAL_NPC_DOCTORCONSULT_TALKER_TEXT :
"P4187871738" "He's a Pain Specialist.  New field.  Hear of it?"
// IMPERIAL_NPC_DOCTORCONSULT_TALKER_TEXT :
"P3358833721" "We're going to have to bring him in.  It sounds like he's gone septic."
// IMPERIAL_NPC_DOCTORCONSULT_TALKER_TEXT :
"P2932798905" "I don't mind telling you, I'm stumped."
// IMPERIAL_NPC_DOCTORCONSULT_TALKER_TEXT :
"P352826698" "He's looking for a diagnosis.  So I'd like your feedback if you have time."

// IMPERIAL_NPC_NEWSPAPER_INDOCTRINATEDINTERESTED_TEXT :
"P820145247" "Amazing.  Simply amazing."
// IMPERIAL_NPC_NEWSPAPER_INDOCTRINATEDINTERESTED_TEXT :
"P1860587676" "Cole did that?  I am so lucky to live here."
// IMPERIAL_NPC_NEWSPAPER_INDOCTRINATEDINTERESTED_TEXT :
"P3783263317" "Wow!  I didn't know that."

// RIFTENCLOSURE_SCIENTIST_CONVERSATION_TALKING_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P410434763" "I shouldn't exist."





// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_SKETCH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P469507485" "Not there...yet."
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_SKETCH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4240627874" "Just a bit more shading here."
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_SKETCH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2885701106" "Wow, I am really good at this.  That paint-by-numbers course really works."
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_SKETCH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P846349700" "This  vista is perfect for my architect project."
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_SKETCH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P816868375" "Almost there.  There's something missing.  I wish I knew how to draw."

// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_SKETCH_BEINVISIBLE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2565628298" "Oh hey."
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_SKETCH_BEINVISIBLE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3974351935" "Keep sketching."
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_SKETCH_BEINVISIBLE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3491958227" "No distractions.  Keep sketching."

// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_BENCHCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1784511746" "Neutropolis is the only place to be if you're interested in the technology business, so of course I requested a transfer."
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_BENCHCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P863472973" "I heard he got a job at Neuron Technologies Unlimited.  That's quite a coup.  I'd love to know his secret."
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_BENCHCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3432131686" "Really?  What else did she tell you about ArmaTech?  I'm curious."
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_BENCHCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1407881661" "Luna Palisade has simply the best space in Neutropolis.  Hands down."
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_BENCHCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2228985758" "Hauptman Industries has been around for decades.  It's not going anywhere anytime soon."
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_BENCHCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2976478152" "She can't decide whether to use Gripiron Storage or 'Rent Me' Storage.  Do you have any ideas?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_BENCHCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1428522994" "The Willingham Water Treatment Plant is disgusting.  They should have moved it underground with the rats.  So smelly!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_BENCHCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2589172333" "Well of course Keyes Reactor is safe.  I don't know why people get so squeamish when you talk about alternative power sources."
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_BENCHCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1074324312" "No, she slipped and broke her arm.  They patched her up nicely at Cole Memorial.  That Nurse Maggie is a peach!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_BENCHCHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2422878136" "Oh hello."
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_BENCHCHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2058789517" "Hello there.  Anyway, what was I saying?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_BENCHCHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2785201359" "Hm?  Sorry, I was distracted for a moment."

// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P1220916028" "Sure I'll meet you for lunch!  Where do you want to meet up?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P430986842" "I'd love to!  I'll hop the CTA and head over to Imperial City."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P4068138036" "He said WHAT?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P3298903746" "She said WHAT?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P2318381483" "Well that's just ridiculous.  I don't believe it for a second."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P170434278" "I didn't say that.  Did he say that I said that?  What else did he say?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P3903217486" "I'm heading over to the Trader House in Imperial City later. Do you want to meet me?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P3508139716" "I only have a few minutes.  My shift at the hospital starts soon."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P3283922210" "That's what I heard.  Some Resistance guy was picked up and they have him down at the Precinct.  I don't know what he did.  It's not like I'm going to go pop in and inquire."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P2941228090" "Who told you that?  That's ridiculous.  Clockwork don't go 'berserk'."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P946643139" "She absolutely LOVED it.  The programs at the CDEC come highly recommended."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P1459208306" "Get this.  He got too close to the hazard fence and it knocked him right out.  When will people learn?"

// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3039264599" "Uh...private conversation?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3487649808" "Yes?<em>Sorry, not you.  No, someone just walked by."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2989872172" "I know I'm speaking quieter.  There's someone here."

// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_COFFEECHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3422383105" "There was some escape attempt near Neutron Technologies.  Some weird 'failed experiment' or something.  I don't know, I wasn't there.  It's just what I heard."
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_COFFEECHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3101128696" "I'll tell you why we're so safe here in Praetoria.  It's all the training they do over at Lambda Sector, that's why."
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_COFFEECHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4198793227" "I wonder if they'll make Clockwork available for home use.  Wouldn't that be amazing?  I'd never do housework again."
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_COFFEECHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2864181069" "You have to be forward-thinking, my friend, technology will make our lives much more comfortable.  I truly believe that."
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_COFFEECHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2262392051" "Who would ever go Underground?  It's where they do all the maintenance things.  I'm sure it smells down there.  I'll stay up here, thanks."
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_COFFEECHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3667035445" "Does this sound strange?  One of the 'faces' on those Clockwork robots looks like my cousin Fred.  Isn't that funny?"

// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_COFFEECHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1152920273" "What was that?  Oh.  So, where was I?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_COFFEECHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1004252659" "Hello.<em> Anywhere, what was I saying?"

// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_BREAK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3679678216" "Nah, we can get back to it in a sec.  The job never ends, you know?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_BREAK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2185708533" "Me and the boys were thinking of heading over to Imperial City after work for some pasta.  Come with?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_BREAK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2766239991" "We got five more minutes on my watch.  What does yours say?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_BREAK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1858171644" "This isn't what I packed for lunch.  I think I got my wife's lunch bag.  Tuna.  Blecccch."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_BREAK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P959691645" "Remember what I said about skilled labor. We'll never be replaced with Clockwork."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_BREAK_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P114182963" "You shouldn't be in here, you know."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_BREAK_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1590754294" "Hey, who is that?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_BREAK_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P844116355" "Did you see that?  Just jumped over the wall like it was free."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_BREAK_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4128008148" "I'll call security... once the break is over."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CLIPBOARD_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P413985298" "According to my records, the shipment is only a partial.  We should get the rest next week."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CLIPBOARD_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1735384213" "Hm.  This doesn't add up.  Are you sure you checked the manifest?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CLIPBOARD_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P618744940" "We're not scheduled for another maintenance run until early next week."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CLIPBOARD_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1493434539" "No, this says ham on rye.  You wanted roast beef?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CLIPBOARD_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P764237734" "No, this says roast beef. You wanted ham on rye?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CLIPBOARD_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2397479212" "I thought you said you knew where this was supposed to be heading."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CLIPBOARD_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3342852626" "The place is crawling with Clockwork and you just pop in sweet as you please.  Bold."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CLIPBOARD_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2792585280" "Did you see that?  Just walked right in."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CLIPBOARD_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1513503595" "I didn't see a badge.  Did you see a badge?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CLIPBOARD_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3933619634" "Let the Clockwork deal with it.  We got work to do."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CLIPBOARD_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P89320835" "Keep your heads down.  It might just be another security drill."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CLIPBOARD_LISTENER_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2575401381" "Got it."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CLIPBOARD_LISTENER_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P320272764" "Right."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CLIPBOARD_LISTENER_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1806421267" "Whoops."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CLIPBOARD_LISTENER_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P446691185" "Um..."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CLIPBOARD_LISTENER_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2891067662" "Wow.  See that?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CLIPBOARD_LISTENER_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3488024882" "Do you know them?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CLIPBOARD_LISTENER_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3023489188" "Let the Clockwork deal with it."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1775829825" "Not there.  Over there."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P846328859" "Wait.  That's not right.  Can you move it back?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3365594256" "Those aren't the supplies we requisitioned."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1353713656" "Great.  Someone messed up.  Come back here with that crate."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2002673575" "Hold on.  Don't go walking away with that just yet.  I haven't marked it off."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2104594759" "Keeping tabs on this stuff sure is tedious."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1070695637" "I don't see a badge."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3186272097" "You shouldn't be here."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3313525519" "I'm writing down your description for the police."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2757183350" "Just waltzes into a government facility like it's no big thing.  I see how it is.  I'm taking notes.  We'll just see how they feel once the PPD arrest them."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P1422321211" "I'm on break.  The Clockwork will come after you if you make them mad."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P2555526807" "You don't look like you belong here."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_NPC_CMF_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P2880726895" "If I wasn't already on my break, I'd call my supervisor.  You don't have a badge."

// TUTORIAL_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P1823678207" "I really shouldn't have stayed out this late. I'm going to pay for it in the morning!"
// TUTORIAL_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P1162193474" "No, I have to get home. I have to get some sleep before work."
// TUTORIAL_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P3739455034" "I have to be up in a few hours for work. I'm just going to head home."

// TUTORIAL_CELLPHONE_NPC_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P260616964" "Hold on. There's someone messing around out here."
// TUTORIAL_CELLPHONE_NPC_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2267632611" "Looks like I'm not the only one up this late."
// TUTORIAL_CELLPHONE_NPC_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2496268642" "Yeah, there's  something going on. Nothing to worry about though."


// IMPERIAL_CITY_TPN_NEWS_REPORTER_ACTIVE :
"P2690243571" "This is the story of the decade. Open rebellion on the streets of Praetoria? Never seen it before. How's my hair?"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_TPN_NEWS_REPORTER_ACTIVE :
"P4137672268" "We have to get closer. I want to see what the PPD are really up against."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_TPN_NEWS_REPORTER_ACTIVE :
"P719921709" "I've been waiting for something like this to happen my whole career! We have to get the story."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_TPN_NEWS_REPORTER_ACTIVE :
"P1095530478" "Battles outside TPN make for a great story. All I need is a flak jacket and I can really sell this story!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_TPN_NEWS_PRODUCER_ACTIVE :
"P2939699212" "The ratings are through the roof! They were always pretty high, but this is unprecedented!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_TPN_NEWS_PRODUCER_ACTIVE :
"P2319950065" "Since this fighting's broken out, we've had our best week ever. Ratings have never been higher."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_TPN_NEWS_PRODUCER_ACTIVE :
"P70017353" "Look, I don't know how much longer it will last, but I know it's worth your while to advertise now, regardless of price. Everyone is watching!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_TPN_NEWS_PRODUCER_ACTIVE :
"P3393143427" "Yeah, I am a little scared. The PPD can handle this, though, and when they do, we'll be there to make sure they look like heroes."

// NOVA_LOYALISTLOUNGE_NPC_BENCHCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2728067231" "This is a really nice place. It's a good way to wind down."
// NOVA_LOYALISTLOUNGE_NPC_BENCHCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P811849313" "Did you hear? One of those 'Resistance' people tried to get in here today! The PPD took care of it quickly though."
// NOVA_LOYALISTLOUNGE_NPC_BENCHCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3024808364" "I wish I could spend the rest of the day here."
// NOVA_LOYALISTLOUNGE_NPC_BENCHCHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3458114700" "Well, I've got to get going soon. Let's meet up here again tomorrow for lunch."

// NOVA_LOYALISTLOUNGE_NPC_BENCHCHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P851305319" "Just stay back. Don't get involved. The PPD will handle it."
// NOVA_LOYALISTLOUNGE_NPC_BENCHCHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P289413114" "If you intervene, they might think you had something to do with it."
// NOVA_LOYALISTLOUNGE_NPC_BENCHCHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1659078404" "Don't worry about that. The PPD will resolve the situation."

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P1119196402" "I'm not getting in the middle of this."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P3583150695" "Last thing I need is the PPD thinking I had a part in this."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P192481392" "This is nothing to worry about. The PPD will take care of it."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P4233766212" "I'm not getting involved."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P3890797007" "I want no part of this."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P2164654991" "I don't need this stress."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P2653781902" "Looks like the PPD are going to have their hands full today."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P4248138240" "Get away from me."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P2164843997" "Don't drag me into your problems!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P344134650" "I'm not dealing with this nonsense."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P3068915157" "Take your problems elsewhere!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P1610438168" "The PPD will resolve this."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P1028584895" "Why are you doing this?"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P1429009323" "Why are you disturbing our lovely city?"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P777169034" "This is an outrage!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P4155488794" "Emperor Cole will not stand for this disturbance!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P3414709181" "The Praetor will surely hear about this disturbance!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P299059995" "You shouldn't be doing this."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P3990508666" "I'm not interested in your problems."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P1972601211" "What do you think you're doing?"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P2525428608" "This is Praetoria! There's no fighting in the street!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P2730352866" "I hope this is dealt with swiftly!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P4190046181" "How dare you! Stop this nonsense."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P1483496" "You're not getting any help from me."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P551476514" "I don't want the PPD thinking I had anything to do with this!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P3874858321" "Get out of here!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P4182168150" "The PPD will handle this. No need to get involved."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P1306811178" "What is going on here?"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P3119003419" "Do you know who I am?"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P2969913727" "Fighting in the streets? Pathetic."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P3834505858" "I'm sure the PPD will deal with this."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P2197512782" "Is this what Praetoria is coming to?"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P1952331491" "The cops will handle this. Nothing to worry about."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P3919477882" "Looks like I'm going to see some action today."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P2751218083" "You know the PPD are going to arrest you, right?"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P99292595" "The PPD are going to come down hard on you."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P634963017" "This fighting is unacceptable."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P1504278930" "I hope the Praetors lock you away for this."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P4210939895" "This is unacceptable! I'll be talking to the Praetors about this!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P485146108" "Enough of this! Get away from me!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P2834204980" "Don't get me involved in this!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_NPC_GENERAL_ALERTED :
"P611573815" "I want nothing to do with any of this. Leave now!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DUOCHAT_INACTIVE :
"P4276845416" "I love working in Nova Praetoria.  It's so beautiful here and it is such a rewarding job."



// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_BENCHCHAT_TALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1588599596" "I love Neutropolis.  It really is the place to be.  The discoveries that are made here every day are amazing!"



// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_COFFEECHAT_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P83566317" "I really wish they'd do something about the slums in Lambda. I know this is an industrial area, but they are just disgusting."
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_COFFEECHAT_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1496801116" "Neuron's Reach seems just like Imperial City. I don't know if I like that."
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_COFFEECHAT_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1347798816" "I know the Reactor has some great technology, but I really don't know if it should be in the city limits. What if there was a meltdown or something worse?"

// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_COFFEECHAT_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3137426592" "It's alright. At least it's all still safe... better than outside Praetoria."
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_COFFEECHAT_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2485837502" "I wouldn't worry about that. Worry about what would happen if the Resistance took over the city."
// NEUTROPOLIS_NPC_COFFEECHAT_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3448208660" "There's not much that can be done about that."








// PRAETORIA_ATMOSPHERIC_CDEC_PROMOTER_ALL :
"P3050218187" "The CDEC provides you with valuable training to keep your skills up to date! Sign up for a course today!"
// PRAETORIA_ATMOSPHERIC_CDEC_PROMOTER_ALL :
"P1094900540" "If you're looking to try your hand at something new, the Cultural Direction and Education Center can help you get started."
// PRAETORIA_ATMOSPHERIC_CDEC_PROMOTER_ALL :
"P1153600103" "The Cultural Direction and Education Center is here for the citizens of Praetoria, ready to help you reach your potential!"
// PRAETORIA_ATMOSPHERIC_CDEC_PROMOTER_ALL :
"P3785686775" "Looking to enhance your potential through invention and discovery? The CDEC's trainers and the invention tables are always available to the public!"
// PRAETORIA_ATMOSPHERIC_CDEC_PROMOTER_ALL :
"P1098353398" "Looking for a place to develop your next invention? Come to the Cultural Direction and Education Center! Your future starts at the CDEC."
// PRAETORIA_ATMOSPHERIC_CDEC_PROMOTER_ALL :
"P1852801509" "The CDEC is accepting enrollments now. If you've been thinking about doing something to improve yourself, now's the time to apply!"
// PRAETORIA_ATMOSPHERIC_CDEC_PROMOTER_ALL :
"P524915337" "At the CDEC, you're trained in the technologies and materials that can make you better than you've ever dreamed. Register for a class today!"

// PRAETORIA_ATMOSPHERIC_STUDIO55_PROMOTER_MALE :
"P3232201555" "If you're looking for a night you'll never forget, Studio 55 is the place to be!"
// PRAETORIA_ATMOSPHERIC_STUDIO55_PROMOTER_MALE :
"P308640273" "Studio 55 is open to everyone, young and old, day or night! Come and experience it tonight!"
// PRAETORIA_ATMOSPHERIC_STUDIO55_PROMOTER_MALE :
"P2800439370" "Need to unwind? Studio 55's the place for you!"
// PRAETORIA_ATMOSPHERIC_STUDIO55_PROMOTER_MALE :
"P3295191631" "If you need to unwind, come to Studio 55. We've got the best menu in Imperial and the most exciting dance scene in Praetoria!"

// PRAETORIA_ATMOSPHERIC_STUDIO55_PROMOTER_FEMALE :
"P3732579686" "You look like you need to lighten up, hon! Come to Studio 55... you're guaranteed to enjoy it!"
// PRAETORIA_ATMOSPHERIC_STUDIO55_PROMOTER_FEMALE :
"P3335613097" "Why don't you make some time for Studio 55 tonight? You'll never forget it!"
// PRAETORIA_ATMOSPHERIC_STUDIO55_PROMOTER_FEMALE :
"P2008095308" "Come to Studio 55! The party goes on all day and all night, baby!"
// PRAETORIA_ATMOSPHERIC_STUDIO55_PROMOTER_FEMALE :
"P2565510108" "Lookin' for a break after a long day, hon? Come to Studio 55!"
// PRAETORIA_ATMOSPHERIC_STUDIO55_PROMOTER_FEMALE :
"P4083950376" "Studio 55! Tonight! Even the Praetors know there's no more exciting place in Praetoria!"

// FIRSTWARD_FWC_INACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P1944635722" "I'm telling you, they can't keep sending people into First Ward. Eventually we'll have the numbers to break out of this place."
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_INACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P263160026" "Yeah, that's pretty funny, if it hadn't been you living next to Keyes Island the last time they had an 'accident.'"
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_INACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P798102883" "I'd keep that under my heat if I were you. You don't know what these Carnival weirdos are capable of."
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_INACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P186200081" "You think the Resistance gives a rat's behind about what happens in First Ward? If they did, they've have done something by now."
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_INACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P4203282319" "Those people back in The City don't know, don't care. Far as they know this place is an irradiated ruin."
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_INACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P647161176" "We lost another scavenging team the other night. This keeps up, we'll be eating each other before long."
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_INACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P3611927792" "Saw another ghoul out by the marshes last night, tried to get a shot off but by then it was gone. I think it was dragging a body."
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_INACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P3618906324" "Did you see last night when that D.U.S.T. patrol ran into the Resistance ambush? Man, that was something to see. I wish I could have been with 'em. I'd like to take one of those bastards down myself."
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_INACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P3638323739" "Was up on the tower last night, looking out over Sunken City through the binocs. There's some strange stuff going on out there, I tell you."
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_INACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P39070779" "It would be nice if we could plant some vegetables in the dirt plots, get something fresh instead of the same old canned food and junk we scavenge from busted vending machines."
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_INACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P851364486" "If you haven't tried rat, then you ain't got a leg to stand on, my friend."
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_INACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P3211132699" "I don't know, I mean, the Carnival of Light says they're here to help, but we're still here right? Can't they just....magic us out of here or something?"
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_INACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P4145038771" "So you going to join our Warlocks and Wyrms game? We could use another player."
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_INACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P2428049492" "Never thought I'd be playing Warlocks and Wyrms, but no TV, no enternet, what else is there to do?"
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_INACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P1345385611" "Those Carnival types creep me out, don't trust anyone who wears a mask all the time."
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_INACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P485438792" "D.U.S.T. is on the move again, so I'd stay put for the next day or two."
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_INACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P2189872397" "They said I was part of the Resistance, so they sent me here. Better than the BAF, I guess. At least I don't have to wear an orange jumpsuit."
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_INACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P3488805262" "Thought I might try to use one of the Shadowed Paths to get to Mercyview. My aunt and uncle are buried there."
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_INACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P1811164856" "Damn Dregs! What is wrong with those people? We're having a hard enough time as it is without our own giving us grief."
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_INACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P3374475741" "You know, ever since I've been out here my head's actually been a lot clearer. I never realized how much I hated Cole until now."
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_INACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P2537336616" "Something's going on in my head lately. Just feeling angry for no good reason."
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_INACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P338214082" "You've been acting a bit touchy lately, like you're mad all the time, what's up with that?"
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_INACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P2138958869" "My wife's worried too, said I've been flying off the handle for the smallest things."

// FIRSTWARD_FWC_ACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P2355472045" "Get out of here, this is our place!"
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_ACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P444791650" "I ain't taking this crap anymore!"
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_ACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P2856818875" "You aren't going to push this Eltentowner around!"
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_ACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P4062639920" "Take 'em down hard!"
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_ACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P558206196" "Get 'em!"
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_ACTIVE_CONV_TEXT :
"P4026406415" "Oh no you don't!"

// FIRSTWARD_FWC_GUARDS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3215345241" "We've got hostiles advancing on our location!"
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_GUARDS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2491755600" "Fire! Fire! Fire! Don't let them through!"
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_GUARDS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3768250182" "Attack!"
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_GUARDS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2277441529" "For Eltentown!"
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_GUARDS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3977837274" "Take 'em down! Don't give them an inch!"
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_GUARDS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P500303951" "Bogies at the inner perimeter, all units respond!"
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_GUARDS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3100179530" "Here comes trouble."
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_GUARDS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2972186135" "Not again! Don't they ever rest?"
// FIRSTWARD_FWC_GUARDS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P989552655" "Safeties off, let 'em have it!"

// FIRSTWARD_VENDOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2480302740" "Try my new rat kebobs. Featuring my unique blend of six herbs and spices."
// FIRSTWARD_VENDOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3494297038" "I got your franks, your burgers, your tasty afternoon treats, only one hour of service or two pieces of reading material in exchange."
// FIRSTWARD_VENDOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3607504627" "Would you like to try my new 'meat chunks in gravy' bowl? Only cost you two batteries, one book, or a half hour of service."
// FIRSTWARD_VENDOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2278782743" "Have food for trade!"
// FIRSTWARD_VENDOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3776393939" "Fresh from the Sunken City, canned vienna sausages in cream gravy. Get them while they're hot."
// FIRSTWARD_VENDOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1497347998" "I got frog legs, fresh fish straight from the estuary, steamed clams dug just this morning. I got crawdads and shrimp."

// NIGHTWARD_NPC_IDF_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1762696295" "Survey of the area complete. Returning to base."

// NIGHTWARD_DEMON_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P60490876" "I loved her like no mortal ever could... Is that so wrong?"
// NIGHTWARD_DEMON_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1670382395" "I was willing to give up everything for her... and in the end... I did."
// NIGHTWARD_DEMON_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2324701604" "Things could have been so much different... So much brighter."

// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_LIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1520571171" "The light will heal you."
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_LIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3929326111" "Come closer and be healed."

// NIGHTWARD_MM_BOOKSHELF_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P526630020" "Mmm... yes... mmm..."
// NIGHTWARD_MM_BOOKSHELF_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2702132794" "Damn, she beat me to another book... I hate that."
// NIGHTWARD_MM_BOOKSHELF_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P405430656" "Now where is that damned book...? Was here not two years ago."
// NIGHTWARD_MM_BOOKSHELF_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P39012109" "Let's see here... Acts of the Xodia... The Almanac Arcaum... Arcanos Manifesto...<em>...Azmodeon Rising!?<em>Where's the Arcanorum Grimorum??"

// NIGHTWARD_MM_READING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1611629034" "Amray... Onyeh... Omruhn-yeh..?"
// NIGHTWARD_MM_READING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2675391028" "The texts hold the keys..."

// NIGHTWARD_ANGEL_OBSERVE_TEXT :
"P825266105" "So... The heretics fled to this land."
// NIGHTWARD_ANGEL_OBSERVE_TEXT :
"P4169370752" "Such heresies will not go unpunished."

// NIGHTWARD_ANGEL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3318541107" "Such injustices will not go unpunished."
// NIGHTWARD_ANGEL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P496565295" "They crawl under rocks, believing to be hidden... but in the end, they shall all tremble before their maker."

// NIGHTWARD_ANGEL_READING_TEXT :
"P2889252905" "And then there were nine..."
// NIGHTWARD_ANGEL_READING_TEXT :
"P3378163514" "One by one... the heretics fall."
// NIGHTWARD_ANGEL_READING_TEXT :
"P3739992508" "Judge, jury... executioner."
// NIGHTWARD_ANGEL_READING_TEXT :
"P3401549421" "Running is futile, wretched heretics, for the wrath of the heavens is upon thee."
// NIGHTWARD_ANGEL_READING_TEXT :
"P2338398982" "Liars, thieves, murderers, sorcerers... all will be found... all will be judged."

